    "methods_description": "Eight epidural contacts (3 mm length, 1 mm spacing) were placed alongside the dorsal cervical spinal cord, with the fourth contact from the caudal end serving as the reference. Left median nerve electric stimulation followed an auditory cue in blocks of about 5 minutes. Participants counted rare double-stimulus trials and reported the count at the end of each block.",
